      "locale": "cs",
      "sourceLocale": "cs",
      "name": "ip",
      "title": "ip",
      "summary": "Ukazuje/nastavuje routování, zařízení, pravidla routování a tunely. Některé dílčí příkazy jako je `address` mají svou vlastní dokumentaci.",
      "platform": "linux",
      "softwareIds": [],
      "candidateSoftwareIds": [],
      "exampleCount": 8,
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "Vypsat rozhraní s podrobnými informacemi:",
          "command": "ip {{[a|address]}}",
          "line": 9,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L9"
        },
        {
          "description": "Vypsat rozhraní se stručnými informacemi o síťové vrstvě:",
          "command": "ip {{[-br|-brief]}} {{[a|address]}}",
          "line": 13,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L13"
        },
        {
          "description": "Vypsat rozhraní se stručnými informacemi o linkové vrstvě:",
          "command": "ip {{[-br|-brief]}} {{[l|link]}}",
          "line": 17,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L17"
        },
        {
          "description": "Zobrazit routovací tabulku:",
          "command": "ip {{[r|route]}}",
          "line": 21,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L21"
        },
        {
          "description": "Ukázat sousedy (ARP tabulka):",
          "command": "ip {{[n|neighbor]}}",
          "line": 25,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L25"
        },
        {
          "description": "Změnit rozhraní nahoru/dolů:",
          "command": "sudo ip {{[l|link]}} {{[s|set]}} {{ethX}} {{up|down}}",
          "line": 29,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L29"
        },
        {
          "description": "Přidat/Smazat IP adresu k rozhraní:",
          "command": "sudo ip {{[a|address]}} {{add|delete}} {{ip}}/{{maska}} dev {{ethX}}",
          "line": 33,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.cs/linux/ip.md#L33"
        },
        {
          "description": "Přidat výchozí cestu:",
          "command": "sudo ip {{[r|route]}} {{[a|add]}} default via {{ip}} dev {{ethX}}",
